{"id":"00a1afe6095bcabc","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-kolmogorov-zero-one.md","title":"可测尾事件的0–1律","display":"thm-kolmogorov-zero-one — 可测尾事件的0–1律","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-kolmogorov-zero-one","aliases":["43-thm-kolmogorov-zero-one"],"display":"thm-kolmogorov-zero-one — 可测尾事件的0–1律","depends_on":["[[43-df-density-tail]]","[[43-thm-lebesgue-density]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Theorem 4.2.4, print p.5 / PDF p.25","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-kolmogorov-zero-one"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-kolmogorov-zero-one</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kolmogorov-zero-one — 可测尾事件的0–1律"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b793f1206588410b\" href=\"?note=b793f1206588410b\" title=\"43-df-density-tail\">43-df-density-tail</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69e3b28dcc6d43ac\" href=\"?note=69e3b28dcc6d43ac\" title=\"43-thm-lebesgue-density\">43-thm-lebesgue-density</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 4.2.4, print p.5 / PDF p.25"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(E\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span>为可测集合。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b793f1206588410b\" href=\"?note=b793f1206588410b\" title=\"43-df-density-tail\">43-df-density-tail</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tail}(E)\\Rightarrow\\mu(E)\\in\\{0,1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Tail}(E)\\Rightarrow\\mu(E)\\in\\{0,1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若μ(E)&gt;0，取E中的密度1点，利用尾不变性把高相对密度复制到全部同长度柱集，得μ(E)&gt;1−ε，任意ε&gt;0成立。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 4.2.4, print p.5 / PDF p.25。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-density-tail","status":"resolved","id":"b793f1206588410b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-density-tail]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-lebesgue-density","status":"resolved","id":"69e3b28dcc6d43ac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-lebesgue-density]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-density-tail","status":"resolved","id":"b793f1206588410b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-density-tail]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tail}(E)\\Rightarrow\\mu(E)\\in\\{0,1\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1018,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-kolmogorov-zero-one]] — 可测尾事件的0–1律"}],"outgoing":["b793f1206588410b","69e3b28dcc6d43ac"]}